			";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";s:5:"child";a:3:{s:0:"";a:6:{s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:29:"Introducing the LearnDash App";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:52:"https://www.learndash.com/blog/learndash-app-launch/";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:7:"pubDate";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Wed, 01 Oct 2025 13:57:15 +0000";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:13:"Announcements";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"guid";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:34:"https://www.learndash.com/?p=26099";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:11:"isPermaLink";s:5:"false";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:11:"description";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:157:"The LearnDash App is here—your fully branded mobile learning experience. Publish to the App Store and Google Play, engage learners, and grow your business.";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:32:"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/";a:1:{s:7:"creator";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Jaime Marchwinski";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:40:"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/";a:1:{s:7:"encoded";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:4467:"
<p>If you’ve built a successful learning program with LearnDash, it’s time to take the next step.</p>



<p>We’re excited to announce the <a href="https://www.learndash.com/learndash-mobile-app/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash App</a> — a fully branded mobile app for iOS and Android that delivers your LearnDash-powered courses directly to your learners’ phones and tablets. No code. No generic platforms. Just your content, your brand, and a professional learning experience available on the App Store and Google Play.</p>



<p>Whether you’re an agency managing multiple LMS sites, a corporate training team supporting distributed learners, or a scaling course creator, the LearnDash App gives you a simple, powerful way to go mobile—without the cost and complexity of custom app development.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-what-is-the-learndash-app">What is the LearnDash App?</h2>



<p>The LearnDash App is a native mobile app experience designed specifically for LearnDash users. It’s not a shared app or an external platform—it’s your own branded app, published under your name, with your logo, and built to match your learning environment.</p>



<p>With the LearnDash App, you can:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Publish your own native app</strong> to the Apple App Store and Google Play</li>



<li><strong>Deliver offline access</strong> to course content for true on-the-go learning</li>



<li><strong>Send push notifications</strong> to boost engagement and learner retention</li>



<li><strong>Enable in-app purchases</strong> for upsells and premium content</li>



<li><strong>Control your app’s branding</strong> from icon to color palette</li>
</ul>



<p>Our team manages the app review and publishing process so you can stay focused on your learners.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-who-is-this-for">Who Is This For?</h2>



<p>We built the LearnDash App for customers who are ready to scale, professionalize, and extend their learning experience beyond the browser.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-agencies">Agencies</h3>



<p>Offer mobile app delivery as part of your LMS service packages—creating new revenue streams without the dev lift. Your clients get a premium product, and you get full control over delivery.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-internal-training-teams">Internal Training Teams</h3>



<p>Support hybrid, remote, and on-the-go teams with branded training that lives on their devices. Make compliance, onboarding, and performance support easier to access—and harder to ignore.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-high-tier-course-creators">High-Tier Course Creators</h3>



<p>For course creators already generating momentum with LearnDash, the app opens a powerful new channel to retain learners, increase completion, and reinforce your brand authority.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-why-it-matters-mobile-first-learning-is-here">Why It Matters: Mobile-First Learning Is Here</h2>



<p>Today’s learners expect mobile access. More than 60% of e-learning users access training on smartphones—and mobile-first learning isn’t a luxury anymore, it’s a necessity.</p>



<p>With the LearnDash App, you can:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Improve course completion by offering offline access</li>



<li>Re-engage learners with timely push notifications</li>



<li>Monetize premium content directly within the app</li>



<li>Build a stronger, more credible brand presence in a competitive market</li>
</ul>



<p>This isn’t just another way to deliver your course. It’s a new way to grow your learning business.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-get-started-today">Get Started Today</h2>



<p>Your learners are mobile. Your brand should be too.</p>



<p>The LearnDash App makes it possible to offer a seamless, branded, mobile-first learning experience that meets the needs of today’s users—and tomorrow’s growth.</p>



<p>Ready to go mobile?<br><strong>→ <a href="https://www.learndash.com/learndash-mobile-app/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Get the LearnDash App</a></strong></p>



<p></p>
