			";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";s:5:"child";a:3:{s:0:"";a:6:{s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Featured Customer: Clay Holland";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:62:"https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-clay-holland/";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:7:"pubDate";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Wed, 10 Sep 2025 19:04:05 +0000";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Customer Showcase";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"guid";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:34:"https://www.learndash.com/?p=26006";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:11:"isPermaLink";s:5:"false";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:11:"description";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:281:"713 Training turned a high-demand legal skill into an online learning business that empowers students to launch full-time or side-hustle careers in bankruptcy petition drafting. With LearnDash, they went from shipping DVDs to delivering instant, professional-grade training online.";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:32:"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/";a:1:{s:7:"creator";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Jaime Marchwinski";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:40:"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/";a:1:{s:7:"encoded";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:4203:"
<p>For over 20 years, <strong><a href="https://713training.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">713 Training</a></strong> has helped thousands of students break into one of the most overlooked and lucrative niches in the legal field: <strong>bankruptcy petition preparation.</strong></p>



<p>This isn’t something taught in paralegal programs—or even law school. But with the right training, anyone from a career-changer to a stay-at-home parent can learn how to draft Chapter 7 and Chapter 13 bankruptcy documents. And 713 Training has been the go-to source for this unique skill.</p>



<p>Today, graduates of 713 Training go on to land roles in law firms or start independent businesses supporting attorneys across the country. Some even build full-fledged agencies, outsourcing work to others while earning six figures from home.</p>



<p>But there was one big challenge holding them back: <strong>outdated content delivery.</strong></p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“We used to ship physical books and DVDs,” says Clay Holland, owner of 713 Training. “Then we tried massive downloads, but that created IP risks and made it harder for students to get started right away.”</p>
</blockquote>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-from-friction-to-freedom-why-713-training-chose-learndash">From Friction to Freedom: Why 713 Training Chose LearnDash</h3>



<p>When Clay reacquired the company after the pandemic, he saw the opportunity to rebuild. And <a href="https://www.learndash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash</a> was the foundation for that transformation.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“We went from 100% physical to 100% digital—and our students love the instant access,” Clay explains.</p>
</blockquote>



<p>With LearnDash, students now:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Get immediate access upon enrollment—no delays, no downloads.</li>



<li>Follow a structured curriculum built around real-world bankruptcy software.</li>



<li>Track their own progress with intuitive course navigation.</li>



<li>Study at their own pace, whether they’re a beginner or seasoned legal pro.</li>
</ul>



<p>713 Training also leverages <strong>WooCommerce</strong> to sell its courses and <strong>LearnDash’s reusable content blocks</strong> to streamline course creation—especially helpful for overlapping modules across multiple training levels.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“The layout is intuitive. Once you learn it, it’s fast. And the ability to re-use content has saved us a ton of time.”</p>
</blockquote>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-a-better-learning-experience-better-business-results">A Better Learning Experience = Better Business Results</h3>



<p>The switch to LearnDash eliminated expensive shipping and printing. It also protected their intellectual property and allowed them to update the curriculum instantly.</p>



<p>But most importantly, it improved the <strong>student experience</strong>—which drives stronger results for learners <em>and</em> the business.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“Our students can earn back their entire tuition by drafting just five petitions. Some of them earn thousands per month working part time. Others go full-time and hit six figures.”</p>
</blockquote>



<p>713 Training is currently expanding its reach—starting with paralegals and notaries, and soon reaching into wider professional markets.</p>



<p>With LearnDash, they now have the platform to scale. Certifications are next, along with community-building tools and a CRM integration.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“LearnDash gave us control without the trade-offs of a locked platform,” Clay says. “It’s flexible, affordable, and lets us build the kind of experience our students need to succeed.”</p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>
