			";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";s:5:"child";a:3:{s:0:"";a:6:{s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:29:"Featured Customer: John Wynne";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:73:"https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-success-test-prep-learn-platform/";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:7:"pubDate";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Wed, 03 Sep 2025 14:34:25 +0000";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Customer Showcase";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"guid";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:34:"https://www.learndash.com/?p=25774";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:11:"isPermaLink";s:5:"false";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:11:"description";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:229:"This customer success story showcases how one education entrepreneur built a thriving test prep business using LearnDash, turning printed study guides into a fully digital, mobile-friendly learning platform that delivers results.";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:32:"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/";a:1:{s:7:"creator";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Jaime Marchwinski";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:40:"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/";a:1:{s:7:"encoded";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:8047:"
<p>When COVID-19 accelerated the shift to digital learning, John was already one step ahead. With over a decade of experience in test preparation—and a family legacy in the education space—he launched his own test prep business in 2018, focused on helping students prepare for entrance exams, particularly for nursing school.</p>



<p>What began as a collection of printed study guides sold on Amazon quickly transformed into a high-performance <strong>test prep online learning platform</strong>, powered by <a href="https://www.learndash.com/learndash-lms/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash</a>.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-from-books-to-a-fully-digital-test-prep-platform">From Books to a Fully Digital Test Prep Platform</h2>



<p>John had a clear roadmap: start with physical test prep books, expand into online courses, and eventually build a mobile experience. When the pandemic hit in 2020, it fast-tracked his vision for digital transformation.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“COVID coming along was a catalyst. Online education started becoming more widely adopted.”</p>
</blockquote>



<p>As he searched for a learning management system (LMS), John needed a solution that could manage complex content—especially in subjects like math and science—and grow with his business.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“I had looked around for quite some time&#8230; and then came across LearnDash. It fit all of our criteria.”</p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-why-learndash-was-the-right-choice">Why LearnDash Was the Right Choice</h2>



<p><a href="https://www.smarteditionacademy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">John’s use case</a> was more advanced than the average course creator. He needed a platform capable of delivering:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Realistic, customizable practice tests that mimic real exams</li>



<li>Seamless user experience across both web and mobile</li>



<li>Support for complex formulas, multimedia, and adaptive content</li>
</ul>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“If you have any complexity or want to do more, LearnDash is great for that.”</p>
</blockquote>



<p>Today, his online learning platform includes:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Interactive content</strong> built with H5P</li>



<li><strong>Custom quizzes</strong> using import/export tools and LaTeX formatting</li>



<li><strong>Searchable video lessons</strong> for easier navigation and retention</li>



<li><strong>AI-powered chat assistant</strong> embedded directly in courses</li>



<li><strong>Mobile app</strong> integration via BuddyBoss</li>



<li><strong>SEO-optimized content previews</strong> to increase traffic and conversions</li>
</ul>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-the-tech-stack-behind-the-success">The Tech Stack Behind the Success</h2>



<p>John’s system goes beyond standard LMS setups. He uses a carefully curated mix of LearnDash features and third-party integrations:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Design Upgrade Pro</strong> for a polished, user-friendly interface</li>



<li><strong>Zapier + Klaviyo</strong> to automate emails and nurture leads</li>



<li><strong>SureCart</strong> to simplify eCommerce and recurring subscriptions</li>



<li><strong>BuddyBoss mobile app</strong>, giving learners an on-the-go experience</li>



<li><strong>Custom-built SEO tools</strong>, including flexible content sampling and transcribed videos</li>
</ul>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“We’ve definitely maxed it out for everything it can do.”</p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-creating-a-mobile-learning-experience-students-expect">Creating a Mobile Learning Experience Students Expect</h2>



<p>While LearnDash works seamlessly on mobile browsers, John realized his users expected a dedicated mobile app. Using BuddyBoss, he launched a custom app that supports rich media, complex math questions, and interactive quizzes.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“Customers love it. They love having a mobile app. It’s almost like a requirement in our space.”</p>
</blockquote>



<p>Although mobile app revenue brings in around $3,000/month—compared to $40,000/month on the web—the app is a valuable differentiator in a competitive industry.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-converting-free-users-into-paid-subscribers">Converting Free Users into Paid Subscribers</h2>



<p>John’s platform is optimized for lead generation and conversion. Here’s how his funnel works:</p>



<ol class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Free practice tests</strong> act as lead magnets.</li>



<li>Registrants are added to <strong>automated email flows</strong> using Klaviyo.</li>



<li>Learners receive <strong>in-course support</strong> from a built-in AI chatbot.</li>



<li>Performance-based feedback is being developed to personalize outreach.</li>
</ol>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“If someone scores 40% instead of 80%, we want to trigger a message like: ‘Hey, check out the video lessons.’”</p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-building-community-and-driving-retention">Building Community and Driving Retention</h2>



<p>To keep learners engaged and reduce churn, John blends automation with community:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Weekly live study sessions</strong> hosted on TikTok</li>



<li>A <strong>33,000+ member Facebook group</strong> for real-time Q&amp;A</li>



<li>Ongoing plans to improve onboarding and add gamification</li>
</ul>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“People cancel and say ‘I’m not using it,’ so we’re looking at ways to improve engagement early on.”</p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-driving-organic-growth-with-seo">Driving Organic Growth with SEO</h2>



<p>One of the most impactful improvements John made was developing a <strong>flexible sampling system</strong>. This lets visitors—and search engines—preview course content before purchasing, similar to reading a portion of a paywalled article.</p>



<p>Combined with <strong>video transcriptions</strong>, the result was a dramatic SEO increase.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“A month or two later, we just skyrocketed in the search results. Anybody with a closed course should be doing that.”</p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-a-scalable-model-for-modern-learning">A Scalable Model for Modern Learning</h2>



<p>John’s journey demonstrates what’s possible with the right platform, the right vision, and the right tools. By combining instructional design best practices with LearnDash’s advanced capabilities, he’s built a test prep learning platform that delivers real results—and stands out in a crowded market.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“I think what we’ve done is more than probably 98% of what people do with LearnDash.”</p>
</blockquote>



<p>We couldn’t agree more.</p>



<p></p>
