			";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";s:5:"child";a:3:{s:0:"";a:6:{s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:36:"Featured Customer: Health Manifested";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:58:"https://www.learndash.com/blog/learndash-customer-success/";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:7:"pubDate";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Wed, 27 Aug 2025 14:15:42 +0000";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Customer Showcase";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"guid";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:34:"https://www.learndash.com/?p=25763";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:11:"isPermaLink";s:5:"false";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:11:"description";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:260:"Learn how Victoria Bagnell turned her spiritual wellness vision into a thriving global learning hub with LearnDash. From frustrating tech challenges to a professional, scalable course platform, this customer success story highlights the power of the right LMS.";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:32:"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/";a:1:{s:7:"creator";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Jaime Marchwinski";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:40:"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/";a:1:{s:7:"encoded";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:5821:"
<p>Victoria Bagnell is the founder of <a href="https://www.healthmanifested.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Health Manifested</a>, an online platform dedicated to making human design, astrology, and spiritual wellness more accessible, intuitive, and affordable. Her membership-based learning system empowers everyday learners and aspiring lightworkers with transformative tools—all in one cohesive online environment.</p>



<p>Her journey to building a global, multi-instructor platform started with limited tools and major roadblocks.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-the-challenge-outgrowing-a-basic-wordpress-lms">The Challenge: Outgrowing a Basic WordPress LMS</h2>



<p>Before switching to <a href="https://www.learndash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash</a>, Victoria used WP Courseware on a basic WordPress setup. But the platform couldn’t keep up with her vision for quality, scale, and collaboration.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“I was never able to achieve the clean, organized look I wanted. The design felt limited and didn’t reflect the quality of my content.”</p>
</blockquote>



<p>Even after custom builds and financial investment, the solution still lacked the collaboration and scalability she needed. She wanted to support multiple instructors and offer a seamless experience without backend complexity.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-the-turning-point-discovering-learndash">The Turning Point: Discovering LearnDash</h2>



<p>Everything shifted when Victoria found <a href="https://www.learndash.com/learndash-lms/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash</a> through the BuddyBoss platform. The combination of course design flexibility and the <a href="https://www.learndash.com/instructor-role/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Instructor Role add-on</a> gave her the tools to deliver on her mission.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“LearnDash gave me the structure and design options I was missing. I can now deliver a professional experience and build a collaborative learning community.”</p>
</blockquote>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-a-true-learning-ecosystem-powered-by-learndash">A True Learning Ecosystem—Powered by LearnDash</h2>



<p>Victoria didn’t just want to teach—she wanted to build an ecosystem where others could teach too.</p>



<p>Today, <a href="https://healthmanifested.com/courses/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">HealthManifested.com</a> supports instructors like Steve Adkins, who teaches mediumship, all powered by LearnDash.</p>



<p>Her complete tech stack includes:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/instructor-role/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash Instructor Role</a> – Enables course creation for guest instructors</li>



<li>Paid Memberships Pro – Manages access levels</li>



<li>WooCommerce<a> </a> – Processes payments securely</li>



<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/ld-add-ons/learndash-certificate-builder/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash Certificate Builder</a> – Rewards milestones and boosts motivation</li>



<li>BuddyBoss – Adds community features for deeper learner engagement</li>



<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/notes-by-learndash/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash Notes</a> – Tracks student progress</li>



<li>A custom-built directory – AI-driven search to help users find instructors by specialty</li>
</ul>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“LearnDash and Instructor Roles let me teach my courses and empower other professionals to shine on my platform.”</p>
</blockquote>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-results-that-speak-for-themselves">Results That Speak for Themselves</h2>



<p>Since adopting LearnDash, Victoria has seen a dramatic improvement in her platform&#8217;s performance:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Professional course design</strong> – Clean layouts that elevate the content</li>



<li><strong>Higher learner engagement</strong> – Better navigation and increased course completions</li>



<li><strong>More site activity</strong> – Frequent logins, especially around live updates</li>



<li><strong>Simplified workflows</strong> – Less time on tech, more time building community</li>



<li><strong>Scalable infrastructure</strong> – Easy onboarding of new contributors</li>



<li><strong>Stronger brand confidence</strong> – Her platform now reflects the true value of her offerings</li>
</ul>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-advice-for-future-course-creators">Advice for Future Course Creators</h2>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>“If you&#8217;re serious about delivering quality courses in a professional and scalable way, LearnDash is absolutely worth it. I spent a lot of time and money trying to make other platforms work—LearnDash gave me the flexibility I needed.”</p>
</blockquote>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-final-thoughts-what-learndash-made-possible">Final Thoughts: What LearnDash Made Possible</h2>



<p>Victoria has invested over $55,000 and nearly 10 years into building her platform. What began as a solo effort is now a global community of spiritual educators and learners—brought together by her vision and powered by LearnDash.</p>



<p>If you’re looking for a course platform that goes beyond basic delivery—one that supports collaboration, customization, and community—LearnDash gives you the tools to turn your vision into reality.</p>
