			";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";s:5:"child";a:3:{s:0:"";a:6:{s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:54:"How Much Can You Make Selling Courses? Expert Insights";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:69:"https://www.learndash.com/blog/how-much-can-you-make-selling-courses/";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:7:"pubDate";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Wed, 16 Jul 2025 14:18:11 +0000";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:19:"Grow with LearnDash";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"guid";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:34:"https://www.learndash.com/?p=25198";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:11:"isPermaLink";s:5:"false";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:11:"description";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:182:"Thinking of selling online courses? Learn how much you could earn, what factors influence your success, and how LearnDash helps creators build scalable, profitable course businesses.";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:32:"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/";a:1:{s:7:"creator";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:17:"Jaime Marchwinski";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:40:"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/";a:1:{s:7:"encoded";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:11424:"
<p>Thinking about launching an online course? You’re not alone—A report via <a href="https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2021/07/13/2262081/0/en/Global-E-Learning-Market-to-Reach-457-8-Billion-by-2026.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">GlobeNewswire</a> stated that the global e-learning market is projected to grow from $250.8 billion in 2020 to $457.8 billion by 2026.&nbsp;</p>



<p>But the real question most aspiring creators ask is: <strong>how much money can I actually make selling courses?</strong></p>



<p>Let’s break it down with expert insights, real-world examples, and a look at how tools like <a href="https://www.learndash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash</a> help course creators scale their earnings.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-what-are-the-average-course-creator-revenues"><strong>What Are the Average Course Creator Revenues?</strong></h2>



<p>Online course revenue can vary dramatically depending on your niche, audience size, pricing strategy, and marketing approach.&nbsp;</p>



<p>Here’s a breakdown of typical incomes when selling courses:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>New course creators</strong> often earn between $500–$5,000/month once they get traction.</li>



<li><strong>Mid-level entrepreneurs</strong> can generate $50,000–$150,000/year with a steady audience and a quality content library.</li>



<li><strong>Top-tier creators</strong> (often in high-demand niches like business, marketing, or certification prep) report six- and even seven-figure annual incomes.</li>
</ul>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p><em>“I had been using a hosted LMS, but grew frustrated with the artificial limitations imposed on me… I made the decision to switch to LearnDash for the flexibility … and so that I would have full control of my content.” — Don C., sharing </em><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/lms-comparison-learndash-vs-kajabi/"><em>why he moved from Kajabi to LearnDash</em></a></p>
</blockquote>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-5-key-factors-that-impact-how-much-money-you-can-make-selling-courses"><strong>5 Key Factors That Impact How Much Money You Can Make Selling Courses</strong></h2>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-1-niche-selection"><strong>1. Niche Selection</strong></h3>



<p>Your niche plays a major role in how much you can make selling courses. Some topics—like project management, business strategy, or financial literacy—command higher prices because they offer clear, career-boosting outcomes. Others, like creative hobbies or lifestyle topics, may attract a wider audience but at lower price points.</p>



<p>High-earning course creators often target niches with strong demand, high perceived value, and an audience willing to invest in results. Think professional development, health and wellness, or money management. These areas not only support premium pricing but also open the door to recurring income through subscriptions or tiered offerings.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-2-course-pricing-strategy"><strong>2. Course Pricing Strategy</strong></h3>



<p>How you price your course directly impacts how much you can make selling courses.&nbsp;</p>



<p>Pricing isn’t just about assigning a number—it’s about positioning, perceived value, and aligning with your audience’s expectations. A $20 course might appeal to a broader base, but a $200 course can generate significantly higher revenue with fewer sales, especially if it offers depth, certification, or transformation.</p>



<p>This is where having a platform that supports flexible pricing models becomes critical. Tools like LearnDash allow you to test and refine your strategy with options like:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>One-time payments</strong> – Ideal for straightforward, self-paced courses or digital products.</li>



<li><strong>Subscriptions</strong> – Great for ongoing education, memberships, or content drip models that provide recurring income.</li>



<li><strong>Bundles</strong> – Useful for grouping multiple related courses, increasing average order value while offering more perceived value to learners.</li>



<li><strong>Memberships</strong> – Enable tiered access and long-term engagement, often paired with community features or additional content.</li>
</ul>



<p>The ability to offer these options helps you tailor your pricing to different customer segments, boost lifetime value, and scale income sustainably.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-3-audience-building"><strong>3. Audience Building</strong></h3>



<p>A larger, more engaged audience means more potential customers. Building an email list, growing your social presence, and forming partnerships all increase your reach and trust.&nbsp; Many successful LearnDash users build lead magnets and email campaigns using integrations like Mailchimp or FluentCRM—driving consistent traffic and conversions. The bigger your audience, the more opportunities you have to sell.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-4-student-engagement"><strong>4. Student Engagement</strong></h3>



<p>Engaged learners are more likely to complete your course, leave positive reviews, and become repeat customers. LearnDash’s built-in tools—like quizzes, gamification, and certificates—help boost completion rates and customer loyalty by making learning more interactive and rewarding. The more engaged your students are, the more value they see—and the more likely they are to invest in future offerings.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-5-upselling-amp-recurring-revenue"><strong>5. Upselling &amp; Recurring Revenue</strong></h3>



<p>Increasing customer lifetime value is key to growing your income.&nbsp;</p>



<p>You can increase your online course revenue with upselling strategies like:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Advanced courses</li>



<li>Private coaching</li>



<li>Exclusive mastermind groups</li>



<li>Downloadable templates</li>



<li>Bonus modules</li>



<li>One-on-one feedback (<a href="https://www.learndash.com/notes-by-learndash/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">as a premium add-on</a>)</li>
</ul>



<p>Recurring revenue models—like monthly memberships, cohort-based programs, or content drip subscriptions—also provide stable, predictable income. With LearnDash and <a href="https://memberdashwp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">MemberDash</a>, it’s easy to offer tiered access, build communities, and deliver ongoing value that keeps learners coming back.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-real-examples-what-learndash-creators-are-earning"><strong>Real Examples: What LearnDash Creators Are Earning</strong></h2>



<p>Curious what success actually looks like? Here are real-world examples of LearnDash creators who have turned their expertise into thriving course-based businesses.</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-showcase-fit-father-project/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Fit Father Project</strong></a>: A health and fitness program for fathers over 40. With over <strong>10,000 members</strong> supported and <strong>75,000+ pounds lost</strong>, their LearnDash-powered platform runs at scale using Memberium and BuddyPress.</li>



<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-showcase-dianne-mize/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Dianne Mize Academy</strong></a>: A fine artist turned instructor who offers <strong>22 full-length courses and 3 mini courses</strong> to <strong>400+ active students</strong> worldwide, leveraging LearnDash to reach a global audience.</li>



<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-showcase-full-stack-business-builder/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Full Stack Business Builder (FSBB)</strong></a>: Blending online courses with virtual conferences, FSBB’s first event attracted <strong>152 attendees</strong> and <strong>500,000+ YouTube views</strong>, converting into premium course content and a growing membership base.</li>



<li><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-showcase-world-changers-network/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>The World Changers (TWC) Network</strong></a>: A financial literacy brand that pivoted during COVID-19 to an online model. With LearnDash and BuddyBoss, they built a thriving community of <strong>200+ paying members</strong>.</li>
</ul>



<p>These examples show that it’s possible to build a profitable, scalable business around online learning with the right systems and strategy. Whether you’re just starting or looking to scale, LearnDash gives you the tools to turn your content into consistent income.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-how-learndash-helps-you-grow-your-online-course-revenue"><strong>How LearnDash Helps You Grow Your Online Course Revenue</strong></h2>



<p>LearnDash isn’t just a course builder—it’s your growth engine. LearnDash goes beyond basic course delivery to give you everything you need to build, market, and grow a profitable online course business.</p>



<p>Here’s how LearnDash helps maximize your revenue potential:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Drip-Feed Content:</strong> Keep learners engaged and reduce refund rates</li>



<li><strong>Flexible Monetization:</strong> Offer coupons, bundles, and pricing tiers</li>



<li><strong>Advanced Analytics:</strong> See who’s completing courses and who needs a nudge</li>



<li><strong>Seamless Integrations:</strong> Market smarter with tools like WooCommerce, Stripe, and ConvertKit</li>



<li><strong>Scalable Infrastructure:</strong> Build once, sell forever—no tech team required</li>
</ul>



<p>Whether you&#8217;re just launching your first course or managing a full-blown learning platform, LearnDash provides the structure and scalability to help you turn knowledge into sustainable online income.</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-final-thoughts-earnings-start-with-strategy"><strong>Final Thoughts: Earnings Start with Strategy</strong></h2>



<p>Yes, you can make real money selling courses. From side income to six- or even seven-figure businesses, online courses offer a scalable way to turn your expertise into earnings.</p>



<p>But success doesn’t come from good content alone—it comes from smart systems, learner engagement, and choosing the right tools from day one. And it all runs more smoothly when you have the right tools.&nbsp;</p>



<p>With <a href="https://www.learndash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">LearnDash</a>, you get more than just a course builder—you get a powerful platform designed to help you create, market, and grow a sustainable online course business. If you&#8217;re ready to turn your knowledge into income, LearnDash gives you everything you need to create, market, and scale a profitable course business.&nbsp;</p>
