			";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";s:5:"child";a:3:{s:0:"";a:6:{s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:63:"5 Inspiring LearnDash Creators and What You Can Learn From Them";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:64:"https://www.learndash.com/blog/inspiring-online-course-examples/";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:7:"pubDate";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:31:"Wed, 11 Jun 2025 13:43:14 +0000";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:19:"Sell Online Courses";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:4:"guid";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:34:"https://www.learndash.com/?p=25040";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:11:"isPermaLink";s:5:"false";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}s:11:"description";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:175:"Explore how 5 LearnDash-powered educators and businesses transformed their online courses. Get real strategies to grow your course, increase engagement, and scale your impact.";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:32:"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/";a:1:{s:7:"creator";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:15:"Angie Ricciardi";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:0:"";}}}s:40:"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/";a:1:{s:7:"encoded";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:13279:"
<p>Course creators come from every walk of life — but the most successful ones have something in common: they treat their course like both a <strong>business</strong> and a <strong>learning journey</strong>. They don’t just post some videos online and cross their fingers; they design experiences that guide learners, build community, and deliver tangible outcomes. And sometimes, it&#8217;s nice to see some real-life online course examples!</p>



<p>In this article, we profile five real-world LearnDash creators doing just that. From high-touch coaching programs to on-demand corporate training, these examples will show you how to turn your passion or profession into an impactful, profitable course experience.</p>



<p>Whether you’re a solo entrepreneur or running a fast-scaling team, you’ll walk away with practical, replicable strategies to increase learner engagement, improve course completion, and build meaningful connections. Ready to be inspired? Let’s dive in.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-1-keap-scaling-internal-training-with-a-custom-lms">1.<a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-keap/"> Keap</a> — Scaling Internal Training with a Custom LMS</h2>



<p><strong>Industry:</strong> CRM &amp; Marketing Automation (Corporate)</p>



<p>Keap, a CRM and marketing automation powerhouse, knew that growing its business meant <strong>investing in its people</strong>—and its partners. So, they built a fully customized internal LMS using LearnDash to onboard and certify their network of partners and sales teams. This wasn’t just a static training portal; it was a sleek, branded, role-specific learning machine designed to deliver knowledge at scale.</p>



<p>Their LearnDash system supports over <strong>1,000 users</strong> — a mix of sales pros, marketing specialists, and product experts — all working through structured pathways tailored to their needs. Whether users were learning how to sell Keap’s solutions or diving deep into product features, the experience feels <strong>cohesive</strong> and <strong>targeted</strong> thanks to multi-course structures, automated content drip, and certificates that reward mastery.</p>



<p>What’s particularly brilliant? Keap’s white-labeled platform feels <strong>uniquely theirs</strong>, with clean branding and thoughtfully crafted learning paths that elevate the experience beyond generic corporate training. Instead of a one-size-fits-all LMS, they’ve harnessed LearnDash’s flexibility to create a dynamic, performance-boosting tool that drives results.</p>



<p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> Even large-scale teams can streamline education and improve performance with a tailored LearnDash solution. If Keap can transform complex partner training into a polished, scalable experience, imagine what <em>you</em> could do — even if you’re not managing a global partner  <br><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/72x72/1f517.png" alt="🔗" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-keap/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Read the case study</a></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-2-fit-father-project-building-a-fitness-brand-through-engagement">2.<a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-showcase-fit-father-project/"> Fit Father Project</a> — Building a Fitness Brand Through Engagement</h2>



<p><strong>Industry:</strong> Health &amp; Fitness Coaching</p>



<p>The Fit Father Project isn’t just another fitness program — it’s a <strong>movement</strong> for busy dads who want to reclaim their health, lose weight, and boost vitality (without living at the gym or surviving on kale and almonds). Using LearnDash, the Fit Father team crafted a high-converting course funnel that speaks <em>directly</em> to the challenges their audience faces.</p>



<p>This isn’t a passive, click-through-and-forget experience. The Fit Father Project leverages multimedia content — think engaging videos, downloadable resources, and practical checklists — to keep learners <strong>motivated</strong> and <strong>on track</strong>. Every element is designed to make progress feel achievable, whether you’ve got 20 minutes between work calls or a full weekend to dedicate to your health.</p>



<p>What’s even smarter? They combine solid educational content with <strong>behavior change coaching</strong> — helping dads build lasting habits, not just short-term wins. LearnDash’s progress tracking, certificates, and multimedia lesson capabilities turn the course into a dynamic, interactive system that reinforces success at every step.</p>



<p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> When your content is <strong>laser-focused</strong> on your audience’s real-life struggles, engagement and loyalty follow. LearnDash gives you the tools to build an experience that doesn’t just deliver information but <strong>drives transformation</strong> — and keeps learners coming back for more.<br><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/72x72/1f517.png" alt="🔗" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/customer-showcase-fit-father-project/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Read the case study</a></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-3-dianne-mize-making-art-education-accessible-online">3.<a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-artist-dianne-mize/"> Dianne Mize</a> — Making Art Education Accessible Online</h2>



<p><strong>Industry:</strong> Fine Art Education</p>



<p>Former art professor Dianne Mize has found a way to bring her love of painting to a global audience — all without leaving her studio. With LearnDash, she’s created an online art education platform that offers structured video-based lessons, hands-on exercises, and opportunities for personal critique. This isn’t just “watch me paint”—it’s <strong>interactive, skills-based learning</strong> designed to help students develop real artistic mastery.</p>



<p>Dianne’s approach highlights the power of <strong>focused niche education</strong>. She’s not teaching general business topics or hyped-up marketing hacks; she’s helping artists improve their craft, one brushstroke at a time. With lesson video integration, discussion prompts, and certificates that mark progress, she’s built a community of learners who are deeply engaged and motivated by passion.</p>



<p>Even better? Dianne’s courses create space for connection and feedback — so learners don’t just absorb content in isolation. They share their work, reflect on critiques, and grow together as part of a thriving online community. LearnDash’s tools make it easy to spark those connections, turning solo learning into a <strong>shared artistic journey</strong>.</p>



<p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> You don’t need to teach business or tech to be successful — just deliver passionate, purposeful instruction. With LearnDash, creators like Dianne can scale their reach and impact while staying true to their creative mission.<br><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/72x72/1f517.png" alt="🔗" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-artist-dianne-mize/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Read the case study</a></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-4-sleep-matters-with-lucy-wolfe-coaching-parents-with-compassion">4.<a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-sleep-matters-with-lucy-wolfe/"> Sleep Matters with Lucy Wolfe</a> — Coaching Parents with Compassion</h2>



<p><strong>Industry:</strong> Pediatric Sleep Consultancy</p>



<p>If you’ve ever known a sleep-deprived parent (or <em>been</em> one), you understand just how desperate families can be for relief. Enter Lucy Wolfe: a certified sleep consultant who turned her one-on-one expertise into a <strong>scalable e-learning platform</strong> with LearnDash. Lucy’s courses are designed to gently guide overwhelmed parents through structured, compassionate solutions — no judgment, no one-size-fits-all answers, just actionable support.</p>



<p>Her platform combines educational content with empathetic coaching, helping parents navigate complex challenges like bedtime resistance, night wakings, and nap transitions. Using LearnDash’s quizzes, course sequencing, and private access features, Lucy creates a structured learning experience that feels <strong>safe</strong> and <strong>personalized</strong> — even when delivered at scale.</p>



<p>What’s especially compelling is how Lucy integrates <strong>community support</strong> alongside her educational modules. Parents can connect, share experiences, and cheer each other on, turning solo learning into a <strong>collective journey</strong>. LearnDash’s flexible setup makes it easy to blend private access with public discussion, creating an ecosystem where parents feel supported every step of the way.</p>



<p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> LearnDash helps solo experts turn empathy into empowerment through structured learning. If you have specialized knowledge and a heart for helping others, you can amplify your impact by building a digital course that meets learners where they are — and guides them forward with care.<br><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/72x72/1f517.png" alt="🔗" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-sleep-matters-with-lucy-wolfe/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Read the case study</a></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-5-althris-delivering-agile-project-management-training">5.<a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-althris-agile-project-management-training/"> Althris</a> — Delivering Agile Project Management Training</h2>



<p><strong>Industry:</strong> Professional/Corporate Training</p>



<p>In the fast-moving world of agile project management, staying current on certifications like PRINCE2 and Scrum is <strong>non-negotiable</strong> — and that’s where Althris comes in. This professional training powerhouse uses LearnDash to deliver high-quality certification prep, blending live workshops with self-paced modules and exams that fit busy professionals’ schedules.</p>



<p>What makes Althris stand out is the <strong>polished, highly structured nature</strong> of their learning paths. Using LearnDash’s drip content, course prerequisites, quizzes, and certificates, they craft programs that feel as rigorous as in-person bootcamps — but with the flexibility of online learning. Whether you’re a seasoned project manager or a newcomer trying to level up, Althris’s courses guide you through exactly what you need to know, in the proper order, with built-in accountability.</p>



<p>Their approach shows LearnDash&#8217;s versatility for regulated industries and technical skills. Althris doesn’t cut corners; they build robust training systems that meet professional standards — all while delivering a seamless learner experience. From interactive quizzes to professional certifications, LearnDash powers it all.</p>



<p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> LearnDash can deliver high-quality training for regulated industries and technical skills. If your learners need structured pathways, rigorous assessments, and professional polish, LearnDash has you covered — no matter how niche or complex your subject matter.<br><img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/16.0.1/72x72/1f517.png" alt="🔗" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><a href="https://www.learndash.com/blog/featured-customer-althris-agile-project-management-training/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Read the case study</a></p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-conclusion"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>



<p>These creators prove that great online learning isn’t limited by industry, topic, or business size. Whether you’re training internal teams, teaching a creative skill, or building a personal coaching brand, LearnDash gives you the flexibility and power to design your own learning experience.</p>



<p>From corporate giants like Keap to solo experts like Lucy Wolfe, these examples show how LearnDash can adapt to any vision — and help you <strong>scale it</strong>. The secret sauce? It’s not just about putting content online; it’s about crafting journeys that engage, challenge, and transform your learners.</p>



<p>Take inspiration from these real-world creators. They’ve harnessed multimedia, community, structure, and coaching to create meaningful outcomes. Then, imagine what <em>you</em> could build. Whether you’re just starting or ready to elevate your existing program, LearnDash gives you the tools to <strong>grow your course, your community, and your impact</strong>.</p>



<p>Ready to join this roster of inspiring creators? It’s time to stop dreaming and start building. <a href="https://www.learndash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Try LearnDash today</a> — and turn your knowledge into a thriving learning business.</p>
